 "remarks": "Exceptional 5Br, 3 Full Bath Home & fireplace in the Heart of Cranbury with approximately 2,500sq/ft plus screened in porch. Set on a private 1/2-acre+ oversized lot, this sophisticated home offers an updated kitchen and baths, hardwood floors, skylights, professional landscaping, and an inviting screened porch overlooking beautifully landscaped grounds. Flexible living spaces accommodate an in-law suite or private home office. Enjoy a spacious mudroom/laundry with second refrigerator, attached garage, new sealcoat blacktop driveway, generous storage shed, and private basketball court with paddleball option. A rare blend of privacy, space, and lifestyle--minutes from everything Cranbury has to offer.",
